{"id":"vod_sn_38107","vodId":"38107","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"奇诺之旅","name_cn":"奇诺之旅","date":"2003-01-01","year":"2003","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f0bf5a8c81b0e630979f43f51022a19b.jpg"},"summary":"奇诺（前田爱 配音）是个周游列国的旅行者，她的伙伴叫“艾鲁梅斯”，是一辆会说话的摩托车。奇诺和艾鲁梅斯到各个国家旅行，每次都只在该国家待上三天，了解该国的风土人情，三天之后她便离开前往另一个地方。奇诺原本是“大人之国”一个名字不详的少女，该国规定小孩12岁要接受手术成为 “大人”。因为受到旅行者奇诺的影响，她不想变成“大人”，于是骑着艾鲁梅斯逃离了自己国家，从此以奇诺之名开始周游列国……　　本作是另类的奇幻寓言题材，以单元剧的形式，讲述了奇诺的旅行故事。观众随着奇诺游历各种形形色色的国家，每个国家看似荒诞的风俗背后，是作者对自身世界的思考和追问。本动画改编自时雨泽惠一的轻小说《奇诺之旅》。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:58:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/1hNpkQGnfU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/58DF1GsX1U1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/cujv5E3EEv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/ArjkyFnhza1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/bGnCu4mnNK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/CAtmpNZG3w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/GCDfKmrL441/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/YMDVxqDa3j1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/3pryBKtWEr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/pUDCATBkiv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/eC1HDWkDQx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/kgt90800UF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/9BaiQRdrzD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/10/r4ytvi6CsD1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"